    <!-- ============================ CONSTRUCTION ADVISORY ============================ -->
    <section class="section service-details advisory-ca" id="construction-advisory">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head center" data-reveal>
          <h2 data-reveal-words>Construction advisory</h2>
          <hr class="rule">
        </div>
        <p class="advisory-lede" data-reveal data-delay="1">We don't run the job site day to day. That's the Owner's Rep's job, with the lender watching the budget. As Construction Advisor, we're the outside check: spotting risk early and giving you technical judgment you can trust.</p>
        <p class="advisory-lede" data-reveal data-delay="2">Your Owner's Rep keeps submittals moving and the schedule on track. We step in when it matters most: reviewing high-stakes contract terms, catching schedule problems before they cause delays, and giving you an objective second opinion on the tough calls.</p>
      </div>
    </section>



    
