      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What should be confirmed before engagement?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__body"><p>Experience, availability, reporting frequency, authority and deliverables, plus who's responsible for design, permitting and contractors.</p></div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
